  "instructions": [
    "Soak the cedar planks in water for 30 minutes before cooking.",
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread the smoked fish, onion, and garlic onto skewers.",
    "Brush the ghee and temper onto the fish and onion.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Place the skewers onto the cedar planks.",
    "Close the grill lid and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Flip the skewers and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot with lemon juice squeezed on top."
